WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.290
{Chapter 06}

00:17.620 --> 00:19.169
Pack it up.

00:19.170 --> 00:22.089
Yes, I was about to turn in.

00:22.090 --> 00:25.050
You're free to practice the way you want,

00:25.340 --> 00:27.469
but you have to keep to the schedule.

00:27.470 --> 00:28.549
Understood.

00:28.550 --> 00:29.929
We're sorry.

00:29.930 --> 00:30.930
Good.

00:31.590 --> 00:33.969
Harada, you lock up the equipment room.

00:33.970 --> 00:36.139
Nagakura, you clean up the clubhouse.

00:36.140 --> 00:37.679
Don't cut any corners.

00:37.680 --> 00:39.639
I'm heading home.

00:39.640 --> 00:40.310
Got it.

00:40.650 --> 00:41.650
Bye then.

00:44.980 --> 00:46.859
"Bye then," he said.

00:46.860 --> 00:48.899
That's the Otomurai effect.

00:48.900 --> 00:52.069
It means that he has to accept us
since we got Otomurai's approval.

00:52.070 --> 00:54.869
What are you guys doing?

00:54.870 --> 00:57.450
We've been waiting for you by the gate.

00:59.710 --> 01:01.580
Come help me put these balls away.

01:06.050 --> 01:06.960
What about Gou?

01:06.961 --> 01:08.800
He has to clean the clubhouse.

01:20.020 --> 01:22.849
Hey, I'll wait for you outside.

01:22.850 --> 01:24.520
I hate the dark.

02:09.110 --> 02:14.660
I've heard it said so many times

02:15.410 --> 02:21.580
How it's not going to work out

02:22.540 --> 02:28.090
That nothing will change

02:28.380 --> 02:34.550
Even if I pretended not to listen

02:35.050 --> 02:38.389
I knew it all

02:38.390 --> 02:41.559
I learned this from you

02:41.560 --> 02:49.560
That it's not a failure, even when it is

02:50.940 --> 02:57.529
When I thrust my feelings
on to the drifting clouds

02:57.530 --> 03:04.459
The quiet melodies push me forward

03:04.460 --> 03:10.959
Because the sky is so vast and free

03:10.960 --> 03:18.590
I decided that I wouldn't cry anymore

03:29.560 --> 03:30.560
Huh?

03:31.770 --> 03:32.820
Sawaguchi?

03:42.080 --> 03:43.120
Sawaguchi?

03:47.210 --> 03:48.880
Stop screwing around. Let's go.

03:56.050 --> 03:58.180
What the hell is this?!

03:59.510 --> 04:01.430
Let go of me, you idiot!

04:01.720 --> 04:02.930
What the hell?!

04:08.940 --> 04:11.150
Let go of me, you bastards!

04:12.190 --> 04:14.479
Beg for our forgiveness.

04:14.480 --> 04:16.359
We'll let you go if you get on your knees.

04:16.360 --> 04:17.740
Screw you!

04:38.840 --> 04:42.390
Ask us to spare you, and we'll end this.

04:43.510 --> 04:44.640
No.

04:46.350 --> 04:47.929
I'll give you a haircut.

04:47.930 --> 04:48.939
Stop!

04:48.940 --> 04:50.389
Nothing above the neck.

04:50.390 --> 04:51.399
People will notice.

04:51.400 --> 04:52.270
Tch.

04:52.271 --> 04:54.110
Come on, that's enough. We don't have time.

05:00.610 --> 05:04.119
Don't get carried away just 'cause
you can throw a ball a little fast.

05:04.120 --> 05:07.450
That's enough. Come on, let's go.

05:10.080 --> 05:13.380
Don't compare my pitching to you losers.

05:15.210 --> 05:17.339
You little bastard...

05:17.340 --> 05:19.470
That's enough. We don't want to get caught.

05:34.560 --> 05:35.560
Takumi?

05:37.190 --> 05:38.190
Takumi!

05:40.780 --> 05:42.029
What happened here?

05:42.030 --> 05:43.490
What is this?

05:44.450 --> 05:45.700
Like I know.

05:46.120 --> 05:48.950
Isn't this blood?!

05:50.330 --> 05:51.330
Can you stand?

06:02.380 --> 06:03.380
This way.

06:04.050 --> 06:05.339
Come to my house.

06:05.340 --> 06:07.309
Why would I do that?

06:07.310 --> 06:09.179
Nobody's home.

06:09.180 --> 06:10.930
We need to treat your wounds.

06:12.480 --> 06:13.599
Just forget about it.

06:13.600 --> 06:15.190
I can't do that.

06:16.520 --> 06:17.520
Come on.

06:21.820 --> 06:22.820
Let's go.

06:23.200 --> 06:24.240
See ya later.

06:44.180 --> 06:45.839
You should take a shower.

06:45.840 --> 06:47.010
I'll show you where it is.

06:51.270 --> 06:53.599
You're okay.

06:53.600 --> 06:55.270
Nobody else is here.

06:56.810 --> 06:59.609
They're going to pay for this.

06:59.610 --> 07:00.779
I know.

07:00.780 --> 07:03.490
Just relax and breathe.

07:07.910 --> 07:09.029
Are you okay?

07:09.030 --> 07:10.699
I'm fine.

07:10.700 --> 07:12.450
You're the one who said it.

07:13.250 --> 07:15.709
I'll take that shower now.

07:15.710 --> 07:17.380
I'm feeling really sweaty.

07:26.930 --> 07:28.509
This barely fits me.

07:28.510 --> 07:32.260
Really? They're my pajamas from last year.

07:32.640 --> 07:35.270
All right, lay down on the
bed, and I'll treat your wounds.

07:37.230 --> 07:40.310
My god, how can you even...

07:43.070 --> 07:44.899
Damn, Gou. That really stings.

07:44.900 --> 07:46.280
Stop complaining.

07:49.070 --> 07:50.410
All done.

07:51.080 --> 07:52.870
I'll change out the gauze tomorrow.

07:55.080 --> 07:56.120
Did it hurt?

07:59.170 --> 08:01.749
Don't feel sorry for me.

08:01.750 --> 08:03.800
I don't want your sympathy.

08:04.670 --> 08:06.339
Take the painkillers.

08:06.340 --> 08:08.839
You've got everything here.

08:08.840 --> 08:11.300
Of course. It's our business.

08:11.800 --> 08:13.560
You think I could sleep for a bit?

08:13.850 --> 08:15.639
Yeah, sure.

08:15.640 --> 08:16.640
Thanks.

08:19.310 --> 08:20.310
Gou.

08:21.360 --> 08:23.979
Don't tell anybody else about today, okay?

08:23.980 --> 08:25.989
Don't worry, I wasn't going to.

08:25.990 --> 08:26.990
Good night.

08:37.830 --> 08:39.670
Here. Eat up.

08:45.000 --> 08:47.340
Oh crap, I forgot.

08:47.970 --> 08:49.089
Forgot what?

08:49.090 --> 08:52.970
Oh, I already called your house to
tell them you were spending the night.

08:53.300 --> 08:54.429
You called them?

08:54.430 --> 08:55.430
Yeah.

08:55.810 --> 08:58.479
Your mother seemed fine with it.

08:58.480 --> 08:59.809
That's not a problem, right?

08:59.810 --> 09:01.350
I washed your uniform too, by the way.

09:01.730 --> 09:03.480
You really are...

09:04.190 --> 09:05.519
How do I put this?

09:05.520 --> 09:07.279
You think of everything.

09:07.280 --> 09:08.319
You're flawless.

09:08.320 --> 09:09.649
Really?

09:09.650 --> 09:13.740
Well, I guess I do
think ahead before I act.

09:14.450 --> 09:16.740
Don't you ever get sick of that?

09:17.080 --> 09:18.749
You don't like doing that?

09:18.750 --> 09:21.369
This isn't about me.

09:21.370 --> 09:22.749
I'm asking about you.

09:22.750 --> 09:25.670
Oh, that's right. I need
to get you a toothbrush.

09:27.760 --> 09:30.089
Could I get some more tea?

09:30.090 --> 09:31.260
Make it hot!

09:31.800 --> 09:33.759
You're way too demanding.

09:33.760 --> 09:36.260
So it turns out my little brother...

09:36.890 --> 09:37.890
What is it?

09:40.770 --> 09:42.389
Sawaguchi isn't here.

09:42.390 --> 09:43.689
What?

09:43.690 --> 09:45.019
Did he stay home today?

09:45.020 --> 09:46.229
Hey.

09:46.230 --> 09:50.949
He wasn't around last
night when we left, right?

09:50.950 --> 09:53.239
Yeah, he wasn't.

09:53.240 --> 09:55.069
He's a really timid kid.

09:55.070 --> 09:58.160
I figured he probably went
home early because he got scared.

10:00.160 --> 10:02.830
He was with me until I
got to the equipment room.

10:03.250 --> 10:04.250
Takumi...

10:05.250 --> 10:08.419
Yesterday, he came to
the clubhouse to get us.

10:08.420 --> 10:10.799
He said you were in trouble.

10:10.800 --> 10:15.219
And where was he
while I was in this trouble?

10:15.220 --> 10:17.219
Sawa had nothing to do with it!

10:17.220 --> 10:20.639
He'd never do anything like that!

10:20.640 --> 10:22.730
Nobody said he did.

10:23.060 --> 10:25.850
But he stayed home today.

10:26.230 --> 10:28.229
Let's go when we're done with class.

10:28.230 --> 10:30.069
To his place?

10:30.070 --> 10:31.530
Aren't you worried?

10:38.120 --> 10:40.620
You'd better not punch Sawa, Harada.

10:40.910 --> 10:43.329
Why would I do that?

10:43.330 --> 10:45.620
Because you're making
a face like you want to.

10:46.170 --> 10:49.750
I know you suspect him and plan
to interrogate him or something.

10:51.010 --> 10:53.879
Sawa's not that kind of guy!

10:53.880 --> 10:56.259
I don't suspect him.

10:56.260 --> 11:01.269
Doesn't it worry you that he didn't come
to school after what happened yesterday?

11:01.270 --> 11:03.929
Are you really doing this because
you're worried about Sawa?

11:03.930 --> 11:05.389
Obviously!

11:05.390 --> 11:09.400
I wouldn't be skipping
practice to do this otherwise.

11:14.490 --> 11:16.359
Hey, it's Sawa!

11:16.360 --> 11:17.910
What is he doing?

11:18.530 --> 11:19.910
He climbed a tree?

11:20.370 --> 11:21.950
What is he thinking?

11:22.410 --> 11:25.039
Wait, he's not going to jump, is he?!

11:25.040 --> 11:27.460
Don't be stupid!

11:33.630 --> 11:35.670
Sawa! Get down here!

11:38.720 --> 11:40.179
I'm sorry, Harada.

11:40.180 --> 11:42.139
Sorry for what?

11:42.140 --> 11:44.179
Get down here and tell me.

11:44.180 --> 11:46.559
Aren't you mad at me?

11:46.560 --> 11:48.269
I'm not mad!

11:48.270 --> 11:50.059
Stop yelling, Harada.

11:50.060 --> 11:51.899
Try looking a little less threatening.

11:51.900 --> 11:54.229
Yeah, Takumi. Smile!

11:54.230 --> 11:56.200
And try to sound nicer.

11:56.860 --> 12:00.200
How can I smile when I'm not happy?!

12:00.910 --> 12:03.239
What if he falls?

12:03.240 --> 12:04.790
It'll be your fault.

12:09.460 --> 12:12.459
Sawaguchi, look at me.

12:12.460 --> 12:14.340
You can talk about yesterday, can't you?

12:18.220 --> 12:21.849
When I was waiting outside
the equipment room yesterday,

12:21.850 --> 12:23.810
someone grabbed me from
behind, covered my mouth,

12:24.390 --> 12:26.350
and told me to keep quiet.

12:26.680 --> 12:28.349
I was so scared.

12:28.350 --> 12:30.349
I couldn't even move.

12:30.350 --> 12:34.899
After a while, a few guys came out of the
room laughing about how "the deed was done."

12:34.900 --> 12:36.740
I went to get Gou.

12:37.610 --> 12:42.950
But I was too scared to
see you, so I just ran home.

12:43.660 --> 12:44.660
I'm sorry.

12:45.290 --> 12:46.369
I'm sorry.

12:46.370 --> 12:48.869
Was it Nobunishi?

12:48.870 --> 12:50.789
I think so.

12:50.790 --> 12:53.589
Hey, what should I do?

12:53.590 --> 12:56.270
I was thinking about it all day,
but I can't figure out what to do.

12:56.960 --> 13:01.180
Even climbing up to get a bigger
view didn't give me any answers.

13:01.930 --> 13:04.599
I think we should tell Otomurai.

13:04.600 --> 13:06.469
What's that going to accomplish?

13:06.470 --> 13:08.980
We don't even have proof it was Nobunishi.

13:09.730 --> 13:11.190
The marks on your back.

13:11.850 --> 13:13.480
And then what?!

13:15.150 --> 13:17.609
That'll only get our team shut down!

13:17.610 --> 13:19.529
Who's going to be happy about that?!

13:19.530 --> 13:21.530
Not me!

13:21.860 --> 13:25.279
If I can't play baseball, I
have no reason to go to school!

13:25.280 --> 13:26.989
Then what are we gonna do?

13:26.990 --> 13:28.749
You're just going to say nothing?

13:28.750 --> 13:31.079
I don't know yet!

13:31.080 --> 13:32.080
Damn it.

13:37.380 --> 13:41.510
You'd better at least come to
practice tomorrow, Sawaguchi.

13:52.390 --> 13:53.770
Hold it right there.

13:56.270 --> 13:58.779
Harada, what's wrong?

13:58.780 --> 14:01.069
You don't have your usual zip.

14:01.070 --> 14:02.279
Really?

14:02.280 --> 14:05.280
What were you thinking
skipping practice yesterday?

14:07.240 --> 14:09.579
Why did you skip practice?

14:09.580 --> 14:12.829
Explain to me why you're slacking today.

14:12.830 --> 14:14.709
I'm not slacking.

14:14.710 --> 14:16.999
Well, don't get sloppy with your form.

14:17.000 --> 14:18.549
That'll lead to injuries.

14:18.550 --> 14:19.340
Yes, sir.

14:19.341 --> 14:22.930
I'm letting you start the first
game in our next tournament.

14:24.470 --> 14:25.509
Wow.

14:25.510 --> 14:26.800
He's starting?

14:27.970 --> 14:31.179
I won't be able to pitch if
the catcher is Nobunishi.

14:31.180 --> 14:32.849
What do you mean?

14:32.850 --> 14:36.019
Nobunishi can't catch my pitches.

14:36.020 --> 14:39.190
I don't want to bother playing if
I can't pitch as hard as possible.

14:39.480 --> 14:43.199
You won't know if he can catch
it or not unless you practice.

14:43.200 --> 14:46.989
There's no point in practicing if he
doesn't even care about catching them.

14:46.990 --> 14:48.830
Nobunishi said something similar.

14:49.120 --> 14:51.909
Said he doesn't want to be your catcher.

14:51.910 --> 14:54.620
I can't believe he'd disobey me.

14:57.250 --> 14:59.210
You're sweating a lot.

14:59.670 --> 15:01.919
Are you feeling that bad?

15:01.920 --> 15:02.840
No.

15:02.841 --> 15:04.339
I feel fine.

15:04.340 --> 15:08.759
Nagakura, let's give Harada
a break and call it a day.

15:08.760 --> 15:09.760
Yes, sir.

15:11.220 --> 15:14.599
That's awesome! You both get to start!

15:14.600 --> 15:16.559
I'm just tagging along with Takumi.

15:16.560 --> 15:17.520
Come on!

15:17.521 --> 15:19.859
You're a vital part of this battery.

15:19.860 --> 15:22.860
Who is he going to throw
the ball to without you?

15:25.950 --> 15:27.110
Coach.

15:27.870 --> 15:29.120
What is it?

15:32.240 --> 15:37.119
Don't tell me you do this all the time!

15:37.120 --> 15:39.249
Let's just keep this quiet.

15:39.250 --> 15:40.629
What?!

15:40.630 --> 15:44.259
I'll apologize for losing my
temper and going too far.

15:44.260 --> 15:46.219
An apology isn't enough!

15:46.220 --> 15:51.760
You know better than anyone how
hard we've worked these past two years.

15:52.220 --> 15:55.270
We were good and obedient.

15:55.850 --> 15:58.479
We played baseball even when we hated it.

15:58.480 --> 16:01.150
Why can't you look the
other way this one time?

16:01.610 --> 16:04.939
You wouldn't betray us, would you?

16:04.940 --> 16:08.160
Betray?! You have got to be joking!

16:09.280 --> 16:10.660
Nobunishi.

16:12.080 --> 16:15.910
Do you hate baseball?

16:16.370 --> 16:18.500
I don't hate or like it.

16:18.870 --> 16:22.129
Junior high is just a
stepping stone for high school.

16:22.130 --> 16:28.430
I heard that if you did well on the baseball
team, it'll look good on your application.

16:29.300 --> 16:31.929
We would've been better
off if you hadn't joined.

16:31.930 --> 16:35.469
You get to say what you
want, do what you want.

16:35.470 --> 16:37.849
And now you get to start?!

16:37.850 --> 16:39.020
Are you kidding me?!

16:39.390 --> 16:42.519
You didn't have to endure
anything! It's not fair!

16:42.520 --> 16:45.360
You both can go to hell!

16:48.110 --> 16:51.280
And just so you know,
Kaionji isn't with us.

16:51.910 --> 16:55.660
He's loved baseball
ever since he was a kid.

16:55.990 --> 16:58.580
He's not like us.

17:04.210 --> 17:05.210
Harada.

17:05.210 --> 17:06.210
Yes?

17:06.420 --> 17:08.590
They need you in the principal's office.

17:11.930 --> 17:13.219
Good morning.

17:13.220 --> 17:15.759
I've heard you've been through a lot.

17:15.760 --> 17:17.930
Please, have a seat.

17:22.520 --> 17:27.189
I spoke with Mr. Tomura
and Nobunishi earlier.

17:27.190 --> 17:29.859
What's going to happen to Nobunishi?

17:29.860 --> 17:32.699
He'll be staying at home for a while.

17:32.700 --> 17:34.319
Will he be punished?

17:34.320 --> 17:39.659
Considering this incident,
we have to tread carefully.

17:39.660 --> 17:42.829
Nobunishi and the others
were exemplary students.

17:42.830 --> 17:44.839
It's really hard for me to believe.

17:44.840 --> 17:47.459
There's something I'd like to know.

17:47.460 --> 17:51.129
Have they been doing this
sort of thing the whole time?

17:51.130 --> 17:53.589
No, that's definitely not possible!

17:53.590 --> 18:00.730
So if we consider their futures, we
would like to avoid involving the police.

18:01.270 --> 18:05.980
You may not like this, Harada, but I'd like
you to leave their punishment to the school.

18:06.310 --> 18:12.360
We're committed to ensuring an
incident like this will never happen again.

18:12.650 --> 18:14.989
What do you mean?

18:14.990 --> 18:20.500
First, we'd like the baseball team to
cease all activities for the time being.

18:23.250 --> 18:29.549
This is less of a school issue and
more of an internal baseball team matter.

18:29.550 --> 18:31.879
Ceasing activities can't be avoided.

18:31.880 --> 18:33.549
For how long, sir?

18:33.550 --> 18:35.390
We have a tournament soon!

18:35.840 --> 18:37.549
Tournament?

18:37.550 --> 18:42.389
Unfortunately, it might be
best if our school withdrew.

18:42.390 --> 18:50.230
If people learn that we let you play after such
an incident, there's no telling what will happen.

18:50.780 --> 18:52.989
I would want to spare them that.

18:52.990 --> 18:56.410
But we've worked hard to prepare
for the prefectural tournament...

18:56.870 --> 19:00.159
I understand your pain, Kaionji.

19:00.160 --> 19:05.749
But I believe the whole team needs
to take responsibility for this incident.

19:05.750 --> 19:06.750
But...

19:13.550 --> 19:14.550
Kaionji.

19:16.260 --> 19:18.429
Let's keep practicing.

19:18.430 --> 19:20.309
We can't.

19:20.310 --> 19:22.809
If we don't cooperate,
they might even disband the team.

19:22.810 --> 19:24.309
No way!

19:24.310 --> 19:27.649
We were never that good
of a team to begin with.

19:27.650 --> 19:30.019
Nobody would miss us.

19:30.020 --> 19:32.820
If we can't practice, could I
at least borrow equipment?

19:34.030 --> 19:35.069
Harada?

19:35.070 --> 19:37.949
I want to play baseball.

19:37.950 --> 19:39.870
I don't care about anything else.

19:41.120 --> 19:42.450
I'm going to play.

19:42.830 --> 19:44.450
You won't have the school's permission.

19:45.040 --> 19:48.460
I can still play baseball
without their permission.

19:49.170 --> 19:50.210
Takumi.

19:53.170 --> 19:55.840
I'll give you a key to the equipment room.

19:57.220 --> 19:59.549
You're not going to join us?

19:59.550 --> 20:02.759
I have entrance exams next year.

20:02.760 --> 20:05.730
I'm sorry, but I can't
go against the school.

20:11.230 --> 20:12.689
Are you really going to do this?

20:12.690 --> 20:13.690
Yes.

20:13.691 --> 20:15.819
Then I'll see you after school.

20:15.820 --> 20:17.530
Yeah, see you then.

20:27.500 --> 20:29.000
Kaionji.

20:32.420 --> 20:35.880
You know, I couldn't
just sit there and watch.

20:36.340 --> 20:39.260
I may have come today, but I can't
promise I'll be here again tomorrow.

20:39.590 --> 20:42.889
Now, let's do our usual
running and calisthenics.

20:42.890 --> 20:45.389
Then we'll begin our
position drills right after.

20:45.390 --> 20:46.390
Okay!

20:51.440 --> 20:52.270
Harada.

20:52.270 --> 20:53.190
What?

20:53.191 --> 20:55.439
I want a shot at your pitches.

20:55.440 --> 20:57.439
What? Seriously?

20:57.440 --> 20:58.949
Totally.

20:58.950 --> 21:01.530
I'm a pretty good
batter, I'll have you know.

21:02.570 --> 21:04.529
To the baseball team members on the field,

21:04.530 --> 21:06.490
practice is canceled today.

21:06.870 --> 21:09.960
Please stop immediately and head home.

21:10.710 --> 21:14.750
To the baseball team members on the field,
practice is canceled today.

21:12.210 --> 21:14.750
Bring it, Takumi!

21:27.310 --> 21:31.855
I saw you running after
a sparkling white ball

21:31.856 --> 21:36.399
I saw you running after
a sparkling white ball

21:36.400 --> 21:41.905
As it followed a parabola,
disappearing into distant memories

21:41.906 --> 21:47.410
As it followed a parabola,
